            <column-instance column='[Acceptance Failure Error (copy)_6526701035236478977]' derivation='User' name='[pcto:usr:Acceptance Failure Error (copy)_6526701035236478977:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative'>
              <table-calc ordering-type='Table' type='PctTotal' />
            </column-instance>
